OM is a shared building:\n\nPublic Lobby & Rooftop: Meet other players, chat, and socialize.\n\nPrivate Apartments: Every player has their own apartment with a smart tablet to control lights, doors, textures, and privacy settings.\n\nUpgradable Spaces: Unlock and purchase new environments like the Penthouse, Tranquility, and private rooftops.\n\nSocial Features:\n\nAdd and manage friends.\n\nAccept or decline friend requests.\n\nSee who\u2019s online.\n\nVisit friends directly in their spaces.\n\nSwitch to private mode or set your space as \u201cnot joinable.\u201d\n\nTake selfies inside VR.\n\nMedia & Entertainment:\n\nIntegrated YouTube player in public and private spaces powered by GeckoView.\n\nKey Features at Launch:\n\n300 starting coins (GC).\n\nIn-app purchases for more GC.\n\nInteractive smart phone and tablet for managing friends, privacy, and customization.\n\nExpandable private spaces and environments.\n\nSmooth VR social interaction with multiplayer networking.\n\nThird-Party Software Notices\n\nThis app uses Mozilla GeckoView, which is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0 (MPL-2.0).", "short_description": "Social VR hub with private spaces, friends, and in-game currency."}]}, "developer_name": "Mirarami", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://miraramigames.wixsite.com/mirarami/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mirarami", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mirarami.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "support